      "default": "BASKET_EXECUTION_ACTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED",
      "description": "- BASKET_EXECUTION_ACTION_TYPE_NEW: 신규 주문\n - BASKET_EXECUTION_ACTION_TYPE_AMEND: 정정 주문\n - BASKET_EXECUTION_ACTION_TYPE_CANCEL: 취소 주문",
